  "body": "You may play Clear the Deck from your discard pile. If you do, shuffle it into your deck after resolving its effects.\nAs an additional cost to play Clear the Deck, you may discard up to 3 cards from your hand. Reduce this card’s cost by 1 for each card discarded this way. Draw 1 card for each card discarded this way.",
